{"c":[{"name":"20260820T204108Z-bdc4405c71cbf0c8","text":"always-tdd in-scope is the product's executable behavior; delete 'If something executes it'. Do not list excluded tools or echo a second definition into preflight (#116).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T204616Z-1620ce6f602992b6","text":"Category lists in always-tdd get relabeled (lint is a CLI). Scope by 'would a user of the product observe the break' matches the change-detector test; #116 shipped the smaller 'product's executable behavior' prefix instead.","type":"note"}]}
